    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/4d4408abe3b546605ea76f9ea353a903.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=601 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/4d4408abe3b546605ea76f9ea353a903.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong>\u00a0adventure</strong> game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their\u00a0incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=569 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with  hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game\u2019s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=608 height=377 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=666 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026facing off all manner of walking <strong>clich\u00e9s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=604 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/4d4408abe3b546605ea76f9ea353a903.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=601 height=345 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/4d4408abe3b546605ea76f9ea353a903.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong>\u00a0adventure</strong> game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their\u00a0incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=569 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with  hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game\u2019s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=608 height=377 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=666 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026facing off all manner of walking <strong>clich\u00e9s</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.poster.avif?t=1754456939\" width=604 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.webm?t=1754456939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
